{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1220921-crowdsourcing-dragon-blooded-npcs-vote-thread-1","id":1220921,"title":"Crowdsourcing Dragon-Blooded NPCs - Vote Thread #1","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-21T13:23:15-07:00","id":1220921,"title":"Crowdsourcing Dragon-Blooded NPCs - Vote Thread #1","content":"A few of us decided <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1214311-gm-matchmaking-initiative?p=1217039#post1217039\">here</a> that we'll put together a bunch of Dragon-Blooded NPCs anybody can just throw into their game if they need a statblock or a character idea. Everybody is welcome to participate (submissions go in a separate thread I'll put up when the votes are in).<br /> <br /> <br /> Since constraints foster creativity, there's also going to be a theme of the &quot;week&quot; (I'm actually thinking four week periods - two weeks for submissions only, one week for proposing themes for the next four-week period, and another week for voting on the next theme, picking one of the proposed options). Don't be shy to vote even if you don't want to submit anything - this is an effort by the community, for the community, and telling us which option would be the most useful for your games is plenty helpful on its own.<br /> <br /> <br /> The purpose of this thread is to vote for the theme of our first four-week period! Cast your votes <a href=\"http://www.strawpoll.me/15742834\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=943303#post943303\" target=\"_blank\">Evocations for the demonic tattoos gained from the Pact with Mara sorcerous initiation</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=907071#post907071\" target=\"_blank\">Pyre-Kindler (Soulsteel and Red Jade Grimscythe, Artifact 3)</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1072019-soulsteel-stormcaller-concept-gravedigger?p=1074897#post1074897\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Descent (Stormcaller's Black Jade Reaver Daiklave cousin, Artifact 5)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1074256-combat-with-corebook-shikari-antagonists?p=1074303#post1074303\" target=\"_blank\">Advice for running the corebook shikari antagonists</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3443-aluminiumtrioxid","name":"aluminiumtrioxid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3443_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-22T08:13:09-07:00","id":1221157,"title":"","content":"For future polls, I would suggest distilling the suggestions down into more general concepts. I don't think anyone benefits from multiple sorcerers with the same exact philosophy towards using demon servants, but &quot;sorcerer with a predilection for demon-summoning&quot; encompasses that and many more ideas besides, while still providing a strong theme with a specific focus.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Measure of Hope is right about everything.&quot; - Wise Old Guru<br /> <br /> Currently running an Exalted 2.5 Abyssals game in a homebrew modern shard because I value neither my time or my sanity, and I'm loving almost every minute of it.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23907-measure-of-hope","name":"Measure of Hope","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"190"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-22T08:42:22-07:00","id":1221164,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Measure of Hope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1220921-crowdsourcing-dragon-blooded-npcs-vote-thread-1?p=1221157#post1221157\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For future polls, I would suggest distilling the suggestions down into more general concepts. I don't think anyone benefits from multiple sorcerers with the same exact philosophy towards using demon servants, but &quot;sorcerer with a predilection for demon-summoning&quot; encompasses that and many more ideas besides, while still providing a strong theme with a specific focus.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I think that there's a spectrum there - more specific suggestions can be more evocative, but they're also narrower, increasing redundancy (is really five different takes on the exact same idea the most efficient use of community resources?) and usability (people who just want to grab a quick-statted NPC will always have a use of another warm body to throw into combat, but as we push further into more specific concepts, the fewer people will have an immediate need for those).<br /> <br /> <i>However</i>, I think that deciding how close they want to inch to a given end of the scale should be left up to the applicants who write their suggestions - I'd hate to edit someone's idea down into something other than the thing they wanted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=943303#post943303\" target=\"_blank\">Evocations for the demonic tattoos gained from the Pact with Mara sorcerous initiation</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=907071#post907071\" target=\"_blank\">Pyre-Kindler (Soulsteel and Red Jade Grimscythe, Artifact 3)</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1072019-soulsteel-stormcaller-concept-gravedigger?p=1074897#post1074897\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Descent (Stormcaller's Black Jade Reaver Daiklave cousin, Artifact 5)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1074256-combat-with-corebook-shikari-antagonists?p=1074303#post1074303\" target=\"_blank\">Advice for running the corebook shikari antagonists</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3443-aluminiumtrioxid","name":"aluminiumtrioxid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3443_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-23T08:05:40-07:00","id":1221473,"title":"","content":"How long will the poll be up until it closes and we start making characters?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/565-therian","name":"Therian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar565_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-23T09:22:23-07:00","id":1221484,"title":"","content":"I'm planning to close it on Sunday 24:00 CET, but first I'd have to figure out how to close a poll. Also, I may decide to go to sleep earlier. But I don't think this will unduly distort the results, so whatever.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=943303#post943303\" target=\"_blank\">Evocations for the demonic tattoos gained from the Pact with Mara sorcerous initiation</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=907071#post907071\" target=\"_blank\">Pyre-Kindler (Soulsteel and Red Jade Grimscythe, Artifact 3)</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1072019-soulsteel-stormcaller-concept-gravedigger?p=1074897#post1074897\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Descent (Stormcaller's Black Jade Reaver Daiklave cousin, Artifact 5)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1074256-combat-with-corebook-shikari-antagonists?p=1074303#post1074303\" target=\"_blank\">Advice for running the corebook shikari antagonists</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3443-aluminiumtrioxid","name":"aluminiumtrioxid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3443_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-27T15:56:48-07:00","id":1222535,"title":"","content":"We seem to have a result now! Apparently, &quot;reasonably competent essence 2 combatant&quot; won narrowly (12 votes versus the next highest, the spymaster with 11 votes). I'll put up the submissions thread tomorrow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=9433